","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"mAgjr6kjRqCFk8JWPvobuw","review_id":"xe53_kripij1Il7_8UdmtA","date":"2011-08-31T20:08:52","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9292778968811035,"text_excerpt":"The bar is your typical dive bar in a gentrifying, but not yet gentrified (as in you better freakin' lock your car) neighborhood. Hipsters, PBR (luckily at a reasonable price), and live music. And on Sunday nights the live music is incredible. The band \"Little Maker\" takes the stage... err, designated playing area... and produces some incredible sounds. You should go check it out."},{"business_id":"mAgjr6kjRqCFk8JWPvobuw","review_id":"7iLXjTNViZhrcf-5thfDdQ","date":"2009-08-27T17:46:54","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9238549470901489,"text_excerpt":"I loved the original bar. I remember going in there eons ago when they had the screen printing machines in the back. O'Neil screen printed the saturn screen printing logo on the back of my motorcycle jacket. I wore it with great pride for many many years. It was always a great place to have great drinks and great convos. I remember a song on the jukebox... drinking beer out of my Fred Flinstone mug or something? I have only been to the \"new\" place once. It was OK. Really crowded. But fun for the young hipsters I am sure."},{"business_id":"mAgjr6kjRqCFk8JWPvobuw","review_id":"MXXuEE58OyWNfgTkWwKJxw","date":"2018-11-10T16:09:16","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9227132797241211,"text_excerpt":"It's a dive bar....we ventured because a person in our group has close ties to High Dive in Milwaukee and there are stickers from Saturn bar. We went during the day probably right around open because we were wandering around and wanted a drink.. the people working were nice enough. Upstairs seating is cool...o see how it would be good for shows. I attempted to use the bathroom... after shutting the door I became afraid of the noises I was hearing and noticed the wall didnt quite make it to the floor...finally got the courage to walk to the toilet and it was far gone from being able to use it. Go here to drink and dance... not to pee. Cool place with cool decor."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"mAgjr6kjRqCFk8JWPvobuw","photo_id":"3ij5QrUGn65LRmtumU92Bg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/3ij5QrUGn65LRmtumU92Bg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8277115821838379},{"business_id":"mAgjr6kjRqCFk8JWPvobuw","photo_id":"aZGUnCAdZUeO4zeDo68DXw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/aZGUnCAdZUeO4zeDo68DXw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8211660385131836},{"business_id":"mAgjr6kjRqCFk8JWPvobuw","photo_id":"BlCG0eq5sD8cfxTbhS5OHA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/BlCG0eq5sD8cfxTbhS5OHA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8076887130737305},{"business_id":"mAgjr6kjRqCFk8JWPvobuw","photo_id":"qAFH9wpKCakL1_A6DxLi_A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/qAFH9wpKCakL1_A6DxLi_A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7726766467094421}]},"notebook_case":null}
